<p>You equip an automated, shoulder mounted rocket launcher. Each turn it will launch rockets at up to 2 enemies in weapon range, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">37%, 45%, 50%, 55%, 60%</acronym> steamgun damage as fire.</p><p>The rockets will pass harmlessly through allies, but on-hit effects triggered by them only deal 50% of their usual damage.</p>